{"id":"fcdf27359c31043d","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-filter2-limit-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Limit Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter2-limit-filter — ZFC Filter2 Limit Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-limit-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-limit-filter","58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-limit"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-limit-filter — ZFC Filter2 Limit Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-limit-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-limit-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-limit-filter — ZFC Filter2 Limit Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> (filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterLimit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterLimit}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}limit\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}limit\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}limit\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterLimit}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}limit\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterLimit}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient filter is the canonical two-argument filter on a set, not the unrelated three-argument forcing filter.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-limit</code> is merged here; the alias is normalized to include the ambient filter condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterLimit}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}limit\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal F)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}limit\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterLimit}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2LimitFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)","display":true}],"bytes":1494,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1895","